    "text": "COLUMBUS, Ohio — Ohio’s 988 Suicide and Crisis Lifeline has responded to more than 1 million calls, text messages and online chats since launching in July 2022, Gov. Mike DeWine announced.\nThe milestone highlights the use of the statewide service, which provides free, confidential crisis support around the clock while connecting Ohioans with trained specialists and community resources.",
